<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">中证</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">1,000</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">、</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">国证</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">2,000</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">的百分已经超过</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">90%</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">了</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">可以拿一部分仓位去配没问题</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">但很难去重仓长拿</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">；</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">第三</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">进低位的传统板块</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">现在指数虽然位置不低</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">但很多板块还在低位这些板块之前表现都一般</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">比如医药消费光伏化工等等</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">他们的优势在于位置低</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">中长线空间大</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">可能涨的时候没有其他多</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">但一旦止住震荡回调他们跌不到哪去</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">而且拉长时间看</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">还会再涨起来</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">这也是目前看最攻守兼备的方向</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">；</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">第四</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">高股息防御性板块他们是在大盘</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">震荡的时候去配</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">现在大盘已经突破如果继续大涨他们的表现可能不会太好</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">但上一个视频我们也分析了</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">现在大盘还是有些问题的</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">回调震荡甚至假突破也不是没可能</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">配一些高股息板块</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">可以当做一个无风险对冲</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">一旦大盘震荡回调</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">他们的作用就显现了</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">大不了就当是空仓的部分了</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">红利现在的股息率都在</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">6%</span></span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">左右下方空间不大</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">最多就是不涨</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">综上所述</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">如果用满仓来应对现在的上涨趋势</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">该如何配置最稳健大家心里应该有数了</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\" textstyle=\"\">！</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">刘广义</span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\">A0630624060004</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><span leaf=\"\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">投资有风险</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">入市需谨慎</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><span leaf=\"\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">个人观点</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">仅供参考</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">案例截图</span></font><span leaf=\"\"> </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">不做投资依据</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><span leaf=\"\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 9pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">上海凯石证券投资咨询有限公司</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 9pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><section style=\"margin-top: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p></div>",
